 od or beverage while in costume\, with the exception of water\n•  D
 o not remove costumes from their assigned dressing rooms or from the the
 ater\n•  Remove all bobby pins used to secure head pieces and wigs 
 following their use\n•  Return all headpieces to their assigned bag
 s\n•  Comply fully with any and all updates to Ballet Arkansas’ w
